<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to FormaChat</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 40px;">

    <img src="{{emailBannerUrl}}" alt="FormaChat" width="480" style="width:100%; max-width:480px; display:block; margin:32px auto 28px; border:0;">

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 16px;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 24px;">
      You're in! Your FormaChat account is ready. FormaChat lets you deploy AI-powered customer support in minutes, trained on your own data, live 24/7. Here's how to get started:
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#333333; margin:0 0 28px;">
      1. Create your business profile - add your name, hours, products, FAQs, and tone.<br>
      2. Upload your knowledge - menus, PDFs, policies, images. Your AI learns from all of it.<br>
      3. Embed the chat widget - one snippet, works on any website, and you're live.
    </p>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 28px;">
      <a href="https://formachat.com/#/dashboard" style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 30px; background:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:15px;">Create My First Agent</a>
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#777777; margin:0;">
      Need help getting set up? Just reply to this email, or reach us at <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f;">support@formachat.com</a>.
    </p>

    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #636b2f; opacity:0.25; margin:32px 0 20px;">

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; margin:0;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.<br>
      If you didn't create this account, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
